    <string name="power_guide_stats_dialog_subtitle">Understand battery discharge model and calculation mechanisms</string>
    <string name="power_guide_stats_cycle_title">Cycle &amp; Reset Mechanism</string>
    <string name="power_guide_stats_cycle_desc">• Unplugging the charger automatically starts a new discharge cycle and captures the initial level.\n• You can manually reset current cycle sampling at any time via the top trash icon.\n• Current snapshots can be viewed or saved from the history records dialog.</string>



